{"articleNo":"57419","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=57419&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2012학년도 1학기 방학 중 근로장학생 신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.06.19","hit":"7939","attachments":[{"name":"2012학년도 1학기 방학 중 부서별 근로장학생 시간배정 현황.xls","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=57419&attachNo=1269"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'\"></span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">2012학년도 1학기 방학 중 근로장학생 신청 안내</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2012학년도 1학기 방학중 근로장학생을 모집하오니 희망하는 학생은 기한 내에</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">해당부서로 신청하시기 바랍니다. </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">(희망부서는 첨부파일참고)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">1. 국가 근로장학생</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 자격 및 선발요건 : 재학생 중 한국장학재단 근로장학생으로 추천된 자</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(해당자는 개인별 문자 통보)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 근로기간 : 2012. 6. 23(토) ~ 8. 31(금)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 근로부서 : 붙임</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 신청방법 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: -1.6pt; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">근로장학생 희망부서 근무 신청[직접방문 또는 전화] (6. 19(화) ~ 21(목)까지)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: -1.3pt; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">→ 근로장학생 희망부서 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">온라인신청</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">[근무부서와 협의 완료 후</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> 신청] →</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;근로장학생 선발 확정(6.22(금))</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -136.1pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 136.1pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;※ </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">온라인신청</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">방법 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">원스톱서비스 로그인 - 학생지원 - ‘근로장학생 신청서 제출’에서&nbsp; 희망근무부서 선택 - 신청 클릭 - 완료[별도서류 제출 없음]</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;마. 근로장학금액</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 교내근로 : 시간당 급여 6,000원</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 전공관련산업체 : 시간당 급여 8,000원</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2. 대학 근로장학생 </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 자격요건 : 재학생 중 직전학기 평점평균 1.6이상</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 근로기간 : 2012. 6. 23(토) ~ 8. 31(금)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 근로부서 : 붙임</span></p><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 신청방법 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: -1.6pt; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">근로장학생 희망부서 근무 신청[직접방문 또는 전화] (6. 19(화) ~ 21(목)까지)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: -1.3pt; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">근무부서와 협의 완료 후</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> 선발 - 원스톱서비스 로그인 - </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">학생지원 - </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">'근로장학생 신청서 제출</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">’에서 신청서 작성 및 선발된 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">근무부서</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> 선택 - 신청 클릭 - 신청서 인쇄 - </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">신청서</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">를</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> 희망근무부서로 제출 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">(6. 19(화) ~ 6. 21(목)까지)</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> - 근</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">로장학생 선발 확정(6.22(금))</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;마. 근로장학금액</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 일반근로 : 시간당 급여 4,580원</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 육체근로(일부식당) : 6,000원</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">3. 유의사항</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;가. 휴학자는 신청불가</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;나. 근로시간은 근무 부서에 따라 다름</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -28.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 28.6pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;다. 수업시간과 근로시간 중복불가</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -28.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 28.6pt\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -28.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 28.6pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">붙임 2012학년도 1학기 방학 중 부서별 근로장학생 시간배정 현황 1부.&nbsp;</span></p></span><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -28.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 28.6pt\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -28.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 28.6pt\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; TEXT-INDENT: -28.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 28.6pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2012. 6. 19.</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; TEXT-INDENT: -28.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 28.6pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">학 생 처</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            </span>"}
